# Higgsfield production path

Treat Higgsfield as a first-class Marketing Chief capability, not a ChatGPT side plugin.

- Production surfaces are Cursor MCP at `https://mcp.higgsfield.ai/mcp`, the Cursor Marketplace Higgsfield plugin, and the local Higgsfield CLI plus official `higgsfield-ai/skills` on DESKTOP and AHCM.
- The ChatGPT plugin is non-production. It has no audio, no website-building skill, and agents stall at "I have a good plan" instead of loading and executing a workflow.
- Higgsfield Supercomputer slash skills are a separate product. They are not interchangeable with CLI skills and must not become a second queue.
- Before any generation, run `scripts/Invoke-Higgsfield.ps1 -Action Status` then `-Action Doctor`. Load `get_workflow_instructions` with no argument, then load the matching workflow. Do not call `generate_*` from a text prompt alone.
- A single Higgsfield video clip is typically 15 seconds or less. A 16-second or longer ask is a multi-scene workflow plus edit, not one `generate_video` call.
- Never stop after announcing a plan. Execute the workflow or return the exact blocker.
- Credit spend, Soul training, voice cloning, TikTok publish, website deploy/publish, and billing changes are approval-gated. Read-only tools (`balance`, `models_explore`, `get_workflow_instructions`, `show_generations`) may run first.
- Client generations still require a verified client logo plus one approved reference image. Do not substitute another client's assets. Outputs remain local review drafts.
- Canonical client websites, especially Momentum 360 AI Tech News, still use the existing site factory. Do not invent a parallel Higgsfield website generator for that program.
- Store no Higgsfield tokens, cookies, or session material in this repository. OAuth and `higgsfield auth login` stay human handoffs.
- Read `integrations/higgsfield/skills/higgsfield-marketing-chief/SKILL.md` and `integrations/higgsfield/capability.json` before material Higgsfield work.
